**Cleaning, proved row for row.** The raw trustee files hold {{n_raw_rows}} rows, including {{n_resubmission_duplicates}} resubmitted duplicates. Format B codes its {{n_called_deals_b}} clean-up calls as ordinary repayments. The canonical table rebuilt from those files matches the simulated truth on all {{n_loan_months}} loan-months, with {{canonical_truth_mismatches}} mismatches.

